  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "⚠️ DEPRECATED — this repo is archived",
      "text": "**dsh-voice-mimo has been absorbed into\n[dsh-mimo-agent-tools](https://github.com/ch1bug/dsh-mimo-agent-tools)**\n(single-repo decision, [docs/adr/0001](https://github.com/ch1bug/dsh-mimo-agent-tools/blob/main/docs/adr/0001-single-mimo-transport.md)\nin that repo). No new work lands here; see the issue tracker for the\nmigration trail (this repo #3/#4/#17, that repo #3/#4/#5)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Where everything went",
      "text": "| What | Now lives at |\n|---|---|\n| 🎤/🔊 Browser voice UI (mic input, read-aloud, Settings → Voice, play strips/cards) | dsh-mimo-agent-tools **`./client`** entry (plugin `voice`) |\n| 📄 `voice_transcribe` / 🗣️ `voice_speak` / `voice_understand` agent tools | dsh-mimo-agent-tools **`./mimo`** entry (tools `mimo_asr` / `mimo_speak` / `mimo_audio`) |\n| Reusable MiMo TTS/ASR client (`ctx`-light export) | dsh-mimo-agent-tools `mimo` module export |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Where everything went",
      "text": "Migration carried over all capabilities: read-aloud fix, Plugins-tab settings,\nmanifest-faithful audio store, V2.6 default for `mimo_audio`\n(`mimo-v2.5` retired upstream; ASR/TTS v2.5-series models unchanged)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install (new repo)",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:ch1bug/dsh-mimo-agent-tools\n```\n\nConfigure the MiMo key through DSH Credentials as `XIAOMI_API_KEY`, then open\n**Settings → Plugins** for voice settings."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT — see [LICENSE](LICENSE). Upstream dsh-voice (zhuiyueya) and the\nvision-toolkit settings pattern (Anionex) retain their copyright notices."
    }
